WEBVTT

00:02:58.424 --> 00:03:00.968
to be able to address the problem
in the refugee camp.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.178
And since then,

00:03:02.178 --> 00:03:05.181
I've been on a quest
to make education more accessible

00:03:05.181 --> 00:03:08.476
and more fun and engaging for children
within Kyangwali refugee camp

00:03:08.517 --> 00:03:10.102
through the use of board games.

00:03:10.102 --> 00:03:11.395
And if you don't mind,

00:03:11.437 --> 00:03:14.232
I'm going to share
with you how it all happened.

00:03:14.857 --> 00:03:17.276
One year before, in 2015,

00:03:17.318 --> 00:03:19.862
I was lucky and got an opportunity to go

00:03:19.862 --> 00:03:22.281
and study at African Leadership Academy,

00:03:22.281 --> 00:03:24.492
located in Johannesburg, South Africa.

00:03:24.533 --> 00:03:29.622
And here I was introduced to the idea
of entrepreneurship for the first time.

00:03:29.664 --> 00:03:31.499
And my amazing teachers taught me